WEBVTT

00:06.896 --> 00:08.172
Are ya ready kids?
孩子们准备好了吗？

00:08.275 --> 00:10.034
Aye-aye, Captain!
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.137 --> 00:13.620
- I can't hear you!
- Aye-aye, Captain!
- 我听不到你说话！
- 是啊，队长！

00:13.724 --> 00:16.379
Ooh...
哦...

00:16.482 --> 00:18.517
<i>♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪</i>
<i>♪谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪</i>

00:18.620 --> 00:20.551
<i>♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪</i>
<i>♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪</i>

00:20.655 --> 00:22.655
<i>♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪</i>
<i>♪ 吸水性、黄色
他是多孔的 ♪</i>

00:22.758 --> 00:24.448
<i>♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪</i>
<i>♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪</i>

00:24.551 --> 00:26.551
<i>♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪</i>
<i>♪ 如果是航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪</i>

00:26.655 --> 00:28.689
<i>♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪</i>
<i>♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪</i>

00:28.793 --> 00:30.724
<i>♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪</i>
<i>♪ 然后掉到甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪</i>

00:30.827 --> 00:32.517
<i>- ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
- Ready?</i>
<i>- ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪
- 准备好了吗？</i>

00:32.620 --> 00:36.620
<i>♪ SpongeBob SquarePants
SpongeBob SquarePants ♪</i>
<i>♪ 海绵宝宝
海绵宝宝♪</i>

00:36.724 --> 00:38.482
<i>♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪</i>
<i>♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪</i>

00:38.586 --> 00:41.965
1[pirate] <i>♪ SpongeBob
SquarePants ♪</i>
1[海盗]<i>♪ 海绵宝宝
方裤♪</i>

00:42.068 --> 00:43.241
<i>Ha ha ha ha!</i>
<i>哈哈哈哈！</i>

00:43.344 --> 00:45.517
<i>Ha ha ha ha ha ha!</i>
<i>哈哈哈哈哈哈！</i>

00:45.620 --> 00:46.655
<i>Argh!</i>
<i>啊！</i>

01:27.896 --> 01:31.965
Another miserable start
to another miserable day.
又一个悲惨的开始
又到了悲惨的一天。

01:34.068 --> 01:35.379
Greetings!
问候！

01:35.724 --> 01:38.758
You strike me as a man
with a healthy sense of humor.
你让我觉得你是个男人
具有健康的幽默感。

01:40.448 --> 01:43.172
Well, boy, do I have
just the offer for you.
好吧，孩子，我有吗？
只是为您提供的优惠。

01:43.275 --> 01:45.000
It's a deal you
can really sink...
这是一笔交易你
真的可以沉...

01:45.103 --> 01:47.172
...your chattering teeth into!
……你的牙齿打颤！

01:47.275 --> 01:48.448
Oh, but that's not all!
哦，但这还不是全部！

01:48.551 --> 01:50.620
Do you like to snap your gum?
你喜欢咬口香糖吗？

01:50.724 --> 01:51.517
Well this gum...
那么这个口香糖...

01:51.620 --> 01:54.172
- Ah!
- snaps you!
- 啊！
- 拍拍你！

01:54.551 --> 01:57.000
These priceless gags
can be yours
这些无价的笑话
可以是你的

01:57.103 --> 01:59.965
for the low, low price of 24.99!
超低超低价格24.99！

02:00.068 --> 02:01.241
But if you act now,
但如果你现在就行动

02:01.344 --> 02:06.034
I'll throw in a free set
of steak knives!
我会赠送一套免费的
牛排刀！

02:10.655 --> 02:12.793
Are you finished now, Dad?
爸爸，你现在说完了吗？

02:14.517 --> 02:17.931
Aw! How did you know it was me?
噢！你怎么知道是我？

02:18.034 --> 02:19.862
Bring it in, son.
把它拿进来，儿子。

02:19.965 --> 02:23.310
I just flew into town
on my new sales route
我刚飞进城
在我的新销售路线上

02:23.413 --> 02:25.689
and thought I would drop by.
我想我会过来​​。

02:25.793 --> 02:28.172
And also thought I would
stay for a few days.
并且还以为我会
住几天。

02:28.275 --> 02:29.517
You-- What? Hey!
你——什么？嘿！

02:32.827 --> 02:34.344
Oh, wow!
哦，哇！

02:34.448 --> 02:35.379
Uh. Huh.
呃。呵呵。

02:35.482 --> 02:38.068
Very impressive, Squiddy!
非常令人印象深刻，鱿鱼！

02:38.172 --> 02:40.034
Oh, you really think so?
噢，你真的这么认为吗？

02:40.137 --> 02:41.310
Of course!
当然！

02:41.413 --> 02:43.103
I love clown paintings!
我喜欢小丑画！

02:44.793 --> 02:46.034
Cheer up, son.
儿子，加油。

02:46.137 --> 02:47.310
Hey, why don't you play me
嘿，你为什么不玩我

02:47.413 --> 02:49.793
one of your
famous clarinet tunes?
你的一个
著名的单簧管曲子？

02:49.896 --> 02:53.137
Well, I have been practicing
a new song.
嗯，我一直在练习
一首新歌。

02:57.551 --> 03:00.344
It's the classic
bubble-blowing clarinet!
这就是经典
吹泡泡的单簧管！

03:00.448 --> 03:02.448
It's only 6.99.
只有6.99。

03:04.068 --> 03:08.000
This will be the longest
few days of my life.
这将是最长的一次
我生命中的几天。

03:13.724 --> 03:16.793
Dad! Can you keep
your honking down?
爸爸！你能保留吗
你按喇叭了吗？

03:18.068 --> 03:19.275
Oh, no.
哦，不。

03:21.655 --> 03:23.413
If you like rubber chickens,
如果你喜欢橡皮鸡，

03:23.517 --> 03:25.862
you'll love this bicycle horn!
您一定会喜欢这款自行车喇叭！

03:27.586 --> 03:29.172
Oh, that's right, boys.
哦，没错，孩子们。

03:29.275 --> 03:30.758
I've got horns-a-plenty.
我有很多角。

03:30.862 --> 03:33.241
Fog horns!
雾角！

03:33.344 --> 03:36.413
- French horns!
- Hon, hon, hon!
- 圆号！
- 亲爱的，亲爱的，亲爱的！

03:36.517 --> 03:38.206
Bull horns!
牛角！

03:40.275 --> 03:41.965
- Whoa!
- Just 9.99 each.
- 哇！
- 每个仅需 9.99。

03:42.241 --> 03:43.758
I take all major credit cards.
我接受所有主要信用卡。

03:43.862 --> 03:45.965
But I promise,
I give them all back.
但我保证，
我把它们全部还给我。

03:47.827 --> 03:50.448
Please, do not arm
my annoying neighbors
请不要武装
我烦人的邻居

03:50.551 --> 03:53.103
with even more annoying props!
还有更烦人的道具！

03:53.206 --> 03:55.034
I'm begging you, Father.
我求你了，神父。

03:55.137 --> 03:56.344
- What?
- What?
- 什么？
- 什么？

03:56.448 --> 03:59.137
Squidward, this is your dad?
章鱼哥，这是你爸爸吗？

03:59.241 --> 04:02.103
I thought Mr. Krabs
was your dad!
我以为蟹老板
是你爸爸！

04:02.206 --> 04:03.586
No, Patrick.
不，帕特里克。

04:03.689 --> 04:04.827
And I would appreciate it
我会很感激

04:04.931 --> 04:08.482
if you left my father and I
alone.
如果你离开了我和父亲
独自一人。

04:08.586 --> 04:10.172
Oh, come on, Squidward.
哦，来吧，章鱼哥。

04:10.275 --> 04:12.965
Join in. It's just harmless fun.
加入吧。这只是无害的乐趣。

04:13.068 --> 04:15.103
Yeah, harmless fun.
是的，无害的乐趣。

04:15.206 --> 04:16.448
Put her there, Patrick.
把她放在那里，帕特里克。

04:21.482 --> 04:23.517
Yeah!
是的！

04:25.827 --> 04:26.758
No.
不。

04:27.758 --> 04:29.344
Here, let me help you two up.
来，我来帮助你们两个。

04:33.655 --> 04:35.724
Ugh! Well, today was a wash.
啊!嗯，今天洗了。

04:35.827 --> 04:38.275
Guess I'll try again tomorrow.
我想明天我会再试一次。

04:38.379 --> 04:40.689
I just need to sleep for...
我只需要睡觉...

04:42.379 --> 04:45.000
Twenty-three and a half hours.
二十三个半小时。

04:49.862 --> 04:52.103
You'll be the life
of the slumber party
你将成为生命
睡衣派对的

04:52.206 --> 04:54.965
with my patented whoopee bed!
带着我的专利呼呼床！

04:55.068 --> 04:57.448
Oh! Leave me alone!
哦！请别打扰我！

04:58.482 --> 05:01.655
Always handy
to have a rubber ladder.
总是方便
有一个橡胶梯子。

05:01.965 --> 05:03.206
Whoa!
哇！

05:05.448 --> 05:07.689
Oh, here it is.
哦，在这里。

05:09.482 --> 05:11.068
Ta-da!
哒哒！

05:11.172 --> 05:14.482
Now, that's what
I call a pop-up store!
现在，就是这样
我称之为快闪店！

05:14.586 --> 05:19.344
Hey! Step right up
to Jeffy T's Prankwell Emporium!
嘿！向右走一步
前往 Jeffy T 的普兰克韦尔商场！

05:19.448 --> 05:20.724
I'm a peddler of pranks,
我是一个恶作剧小贩

05:20.827 --> 05:23.862
a giver of gags,
a trader of tricks.
一个恶作剧者，
诡计商人。

05:23.965 --> 05:24.862
You need it,
你需要它，

05:24.965 --> 05:27.862
I sell a novelty
approximation of it.
我卖新奇的东西
它的近似值。

05:27.965 --> 05:31.620
Your friends will be saying,
"Hey! Prank's a lot!"
你的朋友会说，
“嘿嘿！恶作剧真多啊！”

05:31.724 --> 05:35.310
Well, I'm saying pranks
for nothing!
嗯，我是说恶作剧
无缘无故！

05:36.103 --> 05:37.724
Who would have thought
Squidward's dad
谁能想到
章鱼哥的爸爸

05:37.827 --> 05:39.517
would be such a lively guy?
会是这么活泼的一个人吗？

05:39.620 --> 05:41.379
Yeah! He makes me laugh.
是的！他让我发笑。

05:41.620 --> 05:44.344
S-Squidward just makes me sad.
S-章鱼哥只是让我难过。

05:44.448 --> 05:45.655
Nonsense!
废话！

05:45.758 --> 05:47.655
Squidward is hilarious
in his own right.
章鱼哥很搞笑
以他自己的权利。

05:47.758 --> 05:49.931
I mean, his name is Squidward
我是说，他的名字叫章鱼哥

05:50.034 --> 05:51.724
but he's an octopus!
但他是章鱼！

05:51.827 --> 05:54.103
Ha! That was one
of my best pranks.
哈!那是一个
我最好的恶作剧。

05:55.310 --> 05:56.724
That's a good one!
那是一件好事！

05:56.827 --> 05:59.793
Can we see more of your
novelty gags, Mr. Tentacles?
我们可以多看看你的吗
新奇的笑话，触手先生？

05:59.896 --> 06:02.517
Please, Mr. Tentacles is my son.
拜托，触手先生是我的儿子。

06:02.620 --> 06:04.034
Call me Jeffy.
叫我杰菲。

06:09.586 --> 06:11.103
There's more where
that came from!
还有更多地方
那是从哪里来的！

06:11.206 --> 06:14.172
Here are just a few
of my prototype gags.
这里只是一些
我的原型笑话。

06:14.275 --> 06:15.965
Polka dot soap!
圆点肥皂！

06:17.344 --> 06:19.551
Dot's great!
多特太棒了！

06:19.655 --> 06:21.827
Disappearing squid ink!
消失的乌贼墨汁！

06:23.344 --> 06:26.448
Ooh. Think of all the money
I'll save on pants.
哦。想想所有的钱
我会节省裤子。

06:26.551 --> 06:29.379
And don't forget my bombsicles.
别忘了我的炸弹。

06:33.206 --> 06:34.827
Cool.
凉爽的。

06:34.931 --> 06:37.413
That's right! I've developed
thousands of gags
这是正确的！我已经开发了
数千个笑话

06:37.517 --> 06:39.172
over the course of my career.
在我的职业生涯中。

06:39.275 --> 06:41.068
I've even been working on...
我什至一直在努力...

06:41.413 --> 06:43.931
the ultimate gag.
终极笑点。

06:44.034 --> 06:45.862
Oooh.
哦。

06:45.965 --> 06:48.379
But it's just not ready yet.
但它还没有准备好。

06:48.482 --> 06:51.241
I can't seem to figure it out.
我似乎无法弄清楚。

06:51.413 --> 06:53.793
- Oh, oh! We can help!
- Yeah!
- 哦，哦！我们可以提供帮助！
- 是的！

06:53.896 --> 06:57.103
Show us your new gags,
Mr. Jeffyward!
向我们展示你的新笑话，
杰菲沃德先生！

06:57.206 --> 06:58.655
Brilliant idea, boys.
好主意，孩子们。

06:58.758 --> 07:02.517
Hey, why don't you step
into my test kitchen.
嘿嘿，你怎么不迈步呢？
进入我的测试厨房。

07:03.310 --> 07:06.275
You know, this looks a lot
like Squidward's kitchen.
你知道，这看起来很多
就像章鱼哥的厨房。

07:06.379 --> 07:08.793
Think of it as my gag lab.
把它当作我的搞笑实验室。

07:08.896 --> 07:11.206
I've planted some of
my newest pranks around.
我种了一些
我最新的恶作剧。

07:11.310 --> 07:12.172
For instance...
例如...

07:14.413 --> 07:15.310
Huh?
啊？

07:15.413 --> 07:16.793
Rice lice!
稻虱子！

07:19.896 --> 07:22.206
Some people are
so bad at cooking,
有些人是
做饭技术太差了

07:22.310 --> 07:24.275
they can't even boil water.
他们甚至不能烧水。

07:27.965 --> 07:30.758
Especially not
with a flammable pot!
尤其不是
用易燃锅！

07:30.862 --> 07:34.241
He better grab
that fire re-stinguisher!
他最好抓住
那个火再灭火器！

07:34.344 --> 07:35.517
- Gah!
- Here, son.
- 啊！
- 在这里，儿子。

07:35.620 --> 07:37.551
Use this squirting flower.
使用这种喷射花。

07:37.655 --> 07:39.068
Ugh!
啊!

07:41.517 --> 07:44.172
It's the real fire extinguisher.
这才是真正的灭火器。

07:45.137 --> 07:47.413
Well, at least the fire's out.
好吧，至少火已经灭了。

07:47.517 --> 07:50.103
Hey.
嘿。

07:50.241 --> 07:51.379
I'm stuck.
我被困住了。

07:51.482 --> 07:52.758
That's because...
那是因为...

07:53.517 --> 07:56.206
it's also instant bread!
这也是即食面包！

07:56.310 --> 07:57.275
Ta-da!
哒哒！

07:57.379 --> 07:59.275
Yay!
耶！

08:00.724 --> 08:02.310
Get it while it's hot!
趁热吃吧！

08:02.413 --> 08:04.379
It's a fire sale!
这是一次甩卖！

08:04.482 --> 08:06.413
Now, who wants to buy some fun?
现在，谁想买点乐子呢？

08:06.689 --> 08:07.896
That's it!
就是这样！

08:07.100 --> 08:11.448
I'm going where there
won't be any fun!
我要去那里
不会有任何乐趣！

08:12.344 --> 08:13.689
Work.
工作。

08:14.551 --> 08:16.172
What? Wait a minute.
什么？等一下。

08:17.827 --> 08:19.827
Doh! My cornea!
哎哟！我的角膜！

08:20.517 --> 08:22.379
Something's wrong
with this money.
出了点问题
用这笔钱。

08:22.482 --> 08:24.103
I better go tell Mr. Krabs.
我最好去告诉蟹老板。

08:24.206 --> 08:25.103
What?
什么？

08:26.379 --> 08:28.344
I'm not cleaning that up.
我不会清理它。

08:28.448 --> 08:29.620
What's wrong, Squidward?
怎么了，章鱼哥？

08:29.724 --> 08:30.896
Huh?
啊？

08:31.000 --> 08:34.241
Why do your teeth
look weirder than usual?
为什么你的牙齿
看上去比平时更奇怪？

08:35.241 --> 08:36.413
Rubber teeth.
橡胶牙。

08:36.517 --> 08:39.103
And this is a rubber spill.
这是橡胶泄漏。

08:39.206 --> 08:40.965
And rubber money.
还有橡胶钱。

08:41.068 --> 08:43.275
I bought all these pranks
from your dad.
我买了所有这些恶作剧
来自你爸爸。

08:43.379 --> 08:44.655
Aren't they hilarious?
他们不是很搞笑吗？

08:44.758 --> 08:47.034
Mr. Krabs!
蟹老板！

08:47.137 --> 08:50.103
SpongeBob is being
obnoxious again!
海绵宝宝正在
又讨厌了！

08:50.413 --> 08:51.965
Huh? Gyah!
啊？呀！

08:52.068 --> 08:56.275
Got ya! It's my famous
rubber boss!
明白了！这是我的名气
橡胶老大！

08:56.379 --> 08:58.275
For only 99.99!
只需99.99！

08:58.379 --> 09:01.172
I can't take it anymore!
我再也受不了了！

09:04.517 --> 09:05.586
Hey, Squidward!
嘿，章鱼哥！

09:05.931 --> 09:09.724
Your dad sold me
this giant water balloon!
你爸爸把我卖了
这个巨大的水气球！

09:09.827 --> 09:12.137
Only 49.99!
只需49.99！

09:12.241 --> 09:13.310
Catch!
抓住！

09:13.413 --> 09:15.517
Oh, no.
哦，不。

09:17.344 --> 09:19.724
It's full
of jellyfish!
已经满了
水母！

09:29.000 --> 09:33.965
Now to do something I should've
done a long time ago.
现在做一些我应该做的事
很久以前做的。

09:37.413 --> 09:39.241
Beautiful baby.
漂亮的宝贝。

09:40.034 --> 09:41.896
So, daddy dearest.
所以，亲爱的爸爸。

09:42.000 --> 09:44.172
You like pranks, do ya?
你喜欢恶作剧，是吗？

09:44.275 --> 09:48.551
I'll give this some pranks
you'll never forget!
我会给这个一些恶作剧
你永远不会忘记！

10:02.137 --> 10:04.931
Morning, son.
Looking chipper as always.
早上好，儿子。
看起来一如既往的爽朗。

10:05.034 --> 10:08.206
I have a present for you,
Father.
我有一份礼物给你，
父亲。

10:08.310 --> 10:09.448
For me?
为我？

10:09.551 --> 10:10.965
You shouldn't have.
你不应该这样做。

10:11.068 --> 10:14.896
Oh, but you really deserve it.
哦，但你真的值得。

10:15.000 --> 10:17.413
I wonder what it could be.
我想知道它可能是什么。

10:17.517 --> 10:18.620
Ow!
噢！

10:18.724 --> 10:21.206
A surprise boxing glove?
令人惊喜的拳击手套？

10:21.517 --> 10:22.896
I love it!
我喜欢它！

10:23.862 --> 10:26.379
And a cream pie?
还有奶油派？

10:27.103 --> 10:29.275
With itching cream!
用止痒膏！

10:30.862 --> 10:33.655
And a stink bomb too!
还有臭弹！

10:44.103 --> 10:44.827
Uh-oh.
呃哦。

10:50.448 --> 10:52.655
Son! This is it.
儿子！就是这样。

10:52.758 --> 10:54.931
The ultimate gag!
终极笑点！

10:57.551 --> 10:58.827
Ow!
噢！

11:03.517 --> 11:05.344
- Whoa!
- Not my pinky!
- 哇！
- 不是我的小指！

11:05.448 --> 11:07.862
Pretty funny, right?
很有趣，对吧？

11:07.965 --> 11:09.482
Uh-huh! Uh-huh!
嗯嗯！嗯嗯！

11:09.586 --> 11:11.689
Here, knock yourselves out.
在这里，把你们自己打垮。

11:11.793 --> 11:13.310
Yeah!
是的！

11:19.827 --> 11:22.655
You certainly take
after your old man.
你当然拿
追随你的老人。

11:22.758 --> 11:23.827
Ow!
噢！

11:24.758 --> 11:28.586
I'm so proud of you for
figuring out my ultimate gag.
我为你感到骄傲
弄清楚我的终极笑点。

11:30.137 --> 11:32.482
Now I can share it
with the world!
现在我可以分享了
与世界！

11:33.344 --> 11:34.448
Ow!
噢！

11:34.551 --> 11:37.000
I'll just go pack up my things
and head out.
我去收拾一下我的东西
然后出发。

11:37.103 --> 11:41.793
Really? That's all I ever wanted
to hear you say.
真的吗？这就是我想要的一切
听你说。

11:45.310 --> 11:46.241
Got ya!
明白了！

11:46.724 --> 11:48.344
Ha. Ha.
哈。哈。

哈。哈。